| Provider | Model IDs | Reasoning | Notes |
|---|---|---|---|
| **OpenAI** | `openai:gpt-4o`, `openai:gpt-4-turbo`, etc. | Native via Responses API | Effort: none/low/medium/high/xhigh/max; summary: auto/concise/detailed |
| **Anthropic** | `anthropic:claude-3-5-sonnet` | Native thinking blocks | Effort: low/medium/high/xhigh/max; thinking: adaptive (summarized/omitted) |
