- **Per-model timeouts:** 600s (10 min) per request; escalates to fallback on timeout ([agent/utils/model.py](agent/utils/model.py) line ~17 `DEFAULT_REQUEST_TIMEOUT_SECONDS`)

### **Streaming**

- Supported: Tools/updates/values streaming for dashboard UI via `stream_mode` config
- V2 protocol with subgraph namespacing for nested subagent visibility

