- **GitHub auth via proxy** — Agent runs `gh` without real token; LangSmith sandbox proxy injects Basic (git) or Bearer (API) auth
- **Network isolation** — Sandbox has controlled egress; no credential leakage
- **Approval flows:**
  - **Plan mode:** User must call `approve_plan` before code changes executed
  - **PR drafts:** PRs opened as draft; user must manually mark ready-for-review
