### **System Prompt Assembly**

Three-layer composition in [agent/prompt.py](agent/prompt.py):

1. **Shared base** (`OPEN_SWE_SHARED_BASE` line ~120): Core behavior rules, concise style directive, tool call discipline ("MUST call a tool EVERY TURN"), instruction hierarchy
2. **Source guidance** (`replace_source_guidance` line ~340): Slack-specific (thread replies, reactions, message options), Linear (issue comments), GitHub (PR comments), Dashboard (web UI), Schedule (no interaction)
3. **Repository scope** (`_render_repository_scope_section` line ~420): Org-allowed repos from `ALLOWED_GITHUB_ORGS`; blocks modifications outside those orgs unless user provides full GitHub URL

