- **Per-repo override:** If repo root contains `AGENTS.md`, it's read during webhook processing and injected into system prompt
- **Scope:** Repo-level rules (testing requirements, naming conventions, architectural constraints)
- **Middleware:** `SubdirAgentsReadMiddleware` appends ancestor `AGENTS.md` instructions once per run before first edit tool call

**Source:** [agent/prompt.py](agent/prompt.py) lines 120–450; [AGENTS.md](AGENTS.md) "Context Engineering" section.

